{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35231","headline":"天威行 · 顾云","name":"天威行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛮岭高，蛮海阔，去舸回艘投此歇。\n一夜舟人得梦间，草草相呼一时发。\n飓风忽起云颠狂，波涛摆掣鱼龙殭。\n海神怕急上岸走，山燕股栗入石藏。\n金蛇飞状霍闪过，白日倒挂银绳长。\n轰轰砢砢雷车转，霹雳一声天地战。\n风定云开始望看，万里青山分两片。\n车遥遥，马阗阗，平如砥，直如弦。\n云南八国万部落，皆知此路来朝天。\n耿恭拜出井底水，广利刺开山上泉。\n若论终古济物意，二将之功皆小焉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}